{"id":"0cea4f34bf35cc6f","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-hille-yosida.md","title":"Hille–Yosida Theorem","display":"thm-hille-yosida — Hille–Yosida Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hille-yosida","aliases":["58-thm-hille-yosida"],"display":"thm-hille-yosida — Hille–Yosida Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-c0-semigroup.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hille-yosida"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hille-yosida</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hille-yosida — Hille–Yosida Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce3435ba1413059b\" href=\"?note=ce3435ba1413059b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-c0-semigroup.md\">../batch19/58-df-c0-semigroup.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\">\\((X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\)</span> (Banach space over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:D(A)\\subseteq X\\to X\">\\(A:D(A)\\subseteq X\\to X\\)</span> (linear operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S,\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S,\\mathrm{Generator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S,\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S,\\mathrm{Generator}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hille\\text{-}yosida}\\vdash\\;&amp;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\to\\Bigl[\n\\exists T\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X)\\land\\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X)\n\\land\\forall t\\geq0\\;(\\|T(t)\\|\\leq1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow A\\in X^{D(A)}\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\forall x,y\\in D(A)\\;\\bigl(ax+by\\in D(A)\\land A(ax+by)=aA(x)+bA(y)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{graph}(A)=\\overline{\\operatorname{graph}(A)}^{X\\times X}\\land\\overline{D(A)}^{X}=X\n\\land\\forall\\lambda&gt;0\\;\\bigl(\\lambda\\in\\rho(A)\\land\\|(\\lambda I-A)^{-1}\\|\\leq\\lambda^{-1}\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hille\\text{-}yosida}\\vdash\\;&amp;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\to\\Bigl[\n\\exists T\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X)\\land\\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X)\n\\land\\forall t\\geq0\\;(\\|T(t)\\|\\leq1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow A\\in X^{D(A)}\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\forall x,y\\in D(A)\\;\\bigl(ax+by\\in D(A)\\land A(ax+by)=aA(x)+bA(y)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{graph}(A)=\\overline{\\operatorname{graph}(A)}^{X\\times X}\\land\\overline{D(A)}^{X}=X\n\\land\\forall\\lambda&gt;0\\;\\bigl(\\lambda\\in\\rho(A)\\land\\|(\\lambda I-A)^{-1}\\|\\leq\\lambda^{-1}\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the contraction-semigroup form of Hille--Yosida.</li>\n<li>Closedness is expanded as closedness of the graph in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times X\">\\(X\\times X\\)</span>, and linearity and density are displayed directly; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedLinearOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedLinearOperator}_S\\)</span> symbol had no defining source.</li>\n<li>“Dissipative plus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda I-A\">\\(\\lambda I-A\\)</span> surjective for some <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&gt;0\">\\(\\lambda&gt;0\\)</span>” is the Lumer--Phillips formulation and is not substituted for the resolvent bounds here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-c0-semigroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce3435ba1413059b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-c0-semigroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A:D(A)\\subseteq X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S,\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S,\\mathrm{Generator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hille\\text{-}yosida}\\vdash\\;&\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\to\\Bigl[\n\\exists T\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X)\\land\\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X)\n\\land\\forall t\\geq0\\;(\\|T(t)\\|\\leq1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\leftrightarrow A\\in X^{D(A)}\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\forall x,y\\in D(A)\\;\\bigl(ax+by\\in D(A)\\land A(ax+by)=aA(x)+bA(y)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{graph}(A)=\\overline{\\operatorname{graph}(A)}^{X\\times X}\\land\\overline{D(A)}^{X}=X\n\\land\\forall\\lambda>0\\;\\bigl(\\lambda\\in\\rho(A)\\land\\|(\\lambda I-A)^{-1}\\|\\leq\\lambda^{-1}\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedLinearOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda I-A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda>0","display":false}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-hille-yosida.md|58-thm-hille-yosida]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ce3435ba1413059b","ef59807ad934771f"]}